      "id": 33248,
      "name": "flamethrower49",
      "username": "flamethrower49",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-29T19:23:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah… Arkham Horror has a great many of those glitches.  Father Dagon can do a lot with his extra mythos pull.  Zhar is responsible for a lot of wackiness as well.  Eight players often get screwed by the “maximum gates open” rule.  The Deep One track is sometimes volatile, too.</p>\n<p>But hey, if that happens… try again!  You already set it all up, right?  Just redraw starting equipment, maybe investigators, and pull a couple new Mythos cards.  Or hey, if you’re lazy, mulligan the Mythos draw.  “Okay.  We lost that game.  Next?”</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:07:12.066Z",
