      "created_at": "2012-07-02T17:30:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, with Arkham I have this horrible conflict bertween wanting to expand the game and not wanting to make it more complicated… for the most part I keep the action in Arkham itself, without hearalds, and without too many crazy addons.</p>",
